cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reuse this survey, please cite it as below."
title: "Pre-course survey: Data Science for openwashdata"
abstract: >-
  A KoboToolbox XLSForm pre-course survey for the Data Science for
  openwashdata (DS4OWD) course. It collects participant background,
  education and employment, barriers to participation, technical
  experience (programming, Git, IDEs, LLMs) and learning goals. Published
  as a reusable resource so it can be adapted for other courses.
type: dataset
